          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A growing music school in Dublin that needed enrolments from search instead of relying on paid ads and word of mouth."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The school had a website but no SEO strategy. It was invisible for 'music lessons Dublin', 'guitar lessons for kids' and every other search its ideal parents were making every day."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Keyword architecture covering every instrument, age group and location combination",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Technical audit and speed work: the home page went from 4.6s to 1.2s",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A dedicated landing page for each instrument and location, each with its own trial-lesson form",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Content programme answering the questions parents search before they book",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Google Business Profile and course structured data",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Organic traffic grew 213% in nine months. The school ranks on page one for its primary searches and has a waiting list for its core classes for the first time."
        },
